@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction

card "C1 검사\n(유효 sample < 20%\n=> safe intent OFF)" as C1
card "Safe OFF\n(논리 결과)" as SO
card "OFF 요청\n전송" as TX
card "ACK /\nregister readback" as ACK
card "부하 피드백\n(접점, 회전, 유량)" as LF

C1 --> SO
SO --> TX
TX --> ACK
ACK --> LF
note bottom of ACK
  증거가 있는 마지막 단계까지만 주장합니다.
  예: "OFF 요청 ACK 수신,
  실제 정지 미확인".
end note
@enduml
